  data:
    title: Shop Reward Completion
    summary: Shop rewards can be granted by external purchase/ad callbacks, then used
      like normal economy rewards.
    resourcePrefix: demo_shop
    sections:
    - heading: Project setup
      body: Create ShopItem rewards and call CompleteExternalPurchase once from a
        verified store/ad callback. Completion grants rewards immediately; calling
        TryConsumeItem later grants the same rewards again.
